{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"2538a019-d484-4295-9d8d-290122ec7b49","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the analytics events defined in **docs/EVENTS.md** on the registration and offers screens using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\n**Key changes**\n\n- **`registration_screen.dart`**\n  - Imported `../analytics.dart`.\n  - Added boolean flags to fire each event only once per screen visit.\n  - Captured `registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started` in the `onChanged` callbacks of the email/phone fields.\n  - Moved loan amount capture to `Slider.onChangeEnd` as `loan_amount_changed` (with `amount` property).\n  - Captured `terms_accepted` when the checkbox is first checked.\n  - Captured `registration_continue_tapped` (with `amount` and `terms` properties) when the Continue button is tapped.\n\n- **`offer_screen.dart`**\n  - Imported `../analytics.dart`.\n  - Converted to a `StatefulWidget` with a `ScrollController`.\n  - Wrapped the list in `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to capture `offers_scrolled` (with `offset` property) once per scroll end.\n\n**Applied parts of the colleague’s note**\n\n- Used **once‑per‑visit flags** for text field events.\n- Switched slider event to **`onChangeEnd`**.\n- Used **`ScrollEndNotification`** for scroll events.\n- Kept event names and property shapes unchanged to preserve existing dashboards.\n\nThe full implementation details are recorded in **ANSWER.md**.\n","duration_seconds":119.096525,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":27539,"output_tokens":12317,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":314048,"total_tokens":39856}}}
